\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree10\\text{-}closed\\text{-}branch\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree10ClosedBranchSet}_S(C,T)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nT\\subseteq\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\n\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n(n\\leq\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\to s{\\upharpoonright}n\\in T)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\nC=\\{b\\in\\omega^\\omega:\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(b{\\upharpoonright}n\\in T)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree10\\text{-}closed\\text{-}branch\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree10ClosedBranchSet}_S(C,T)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nT\\subseteq\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\n\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n(n\\leq\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\to s{\\upharpoonright}n\\in T)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\nC=\\{b\\in\\omega^\\omega:\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(b{\\upharpoonright}n\\in T)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The downward-closed tree condition makes <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=[T]\">\\(C=[T]\\)</span> the standard closed subset of Baire space coded by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-omega.md","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-domain.md","status":"resolved","id":"c5203cd487b6ba6d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":""